#: ../../source/brain-audit-cycle_SKILL.md:169
msgid ""
"Memory tool availability is environment-dependent. If it is unavailable, "
"use brain files (`~/brain/memory/`) for archival and `session_search` for"
" recall. If it is available, use it for compact durable facts and keep "
"brain files for longer-form writeups."
msgstr ""

